+
+# A rim revolved over a quarter turn on a ring, its end walls rounded at the
+# top (the model of the issue). The edges b_5 and b_23 between the outside of
+# the ring and the end walls are concave and end in the top of the ring, z = 0.
+# The fillet and the chamfer must stop there with a planar cap: nothing above
+# z = 0 changes. At b_5 the end of the trace lay 1e-16 above the top of the
+# ring, and the corner was a patch going up the rim.
+restore [locate_data_file freecad32231_rim_on_ring.brep] b
+explode b E
+
+box above -50 -50 1.e-6 100 100 20
+bcommon b_above b above
+
+blend result b 0.4 b_5 0.4 b_23
+checkshape result
+checkmaxtol result -ref 1.2e-4
+checkprops result -v 1357.05 -deps 1.e-6 -s 2440.41
+bcommon r_above result above
+bcut d_added r_above b_above
+checkprops d_added -v empty
+bcut d_removed b_above r_above
+checkprops d_removed -v empty
+
+chamf result b b_5 0.4 b_23 0.4
+checkshape result
+checkmaxtol result -ref 1.2e-4
+checkprops result -v 1357.18 -deps 1.e-6 -s 2440.41
+bcommon r_above result above
+bcut d_added r_above b_above
+checkprops d_added -v empty
+bcut d_removed b_above r_above
+checkprops d_removed -v empty
